    "Affects certificate validation for RSS feeds, .torrent file downloads, the GeoIP database and the like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影响 RSS 订阅、.torrent 文件下载、GeoIP 数据库等的证书验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a match, the rule skips new matches for this many days. 0 never skips.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配后，规则会在这么多天内忽略新的匹配。0 表示不忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
