    "In the command: %N name, %L category, %G tags, %F content path, %R root path, %D save path, %C number of files, %Z size in bytes, %T current tracker, %I info hash v1, %J info hash v2, %K torrent ID, %M comment. Put quotation marks around a parameter that may contain spaces, as in \"%N\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "In the command: %N name, %L category, %1$G tags, %2$F content path, %R root path, %3$D save path, %4$C number of files, %Z size in bytes, %T current tracker, %I info hash v1, %J info hash v2, %K torrent ID, %M comment. Put quotation marks around a parameter that may contain spaces, as in \"%N\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令中可用：%N 名称，%L 分类，%G 标签，%F 内容路径，%R 根路径，%D 保存路径，%C 文件数，%Z 大小（字节），%T 当前 Tracker，%I v1 信息哈希，%J v2 信息哈希，%K 种子 ID，%M 注释。可能含空格的参数请加上引号，如 \"%N\"。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
